          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "At $t=0$, the initial parameter is the supplied finite-dimensional real vector in the admissible domain by [F1] and the algorithm's hypotheses. No payoff or gradient has yet been recorded. Thus the procedure has a well-defined finite state before its first round.",
